        <definition>int EDF_run</definition>
        <argsstring>(void)</argsstring>
        <name>EDF_run</name>
        <param>
          <type>void</type>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Takes control and runs the EDF main loop. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>0 on normal exit, non-zero on error. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
<para>Exit the startup critical section to unblock any active objects started before calling <ref refid="edf_8h_1a741f22f8d99bbfbb000daeca620ca2a6" kindref="member">EDF_run()</ref>.</para>
        </inbodydescription>
